{
  "name": "app-stack",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "App Stack: Golden Template base + UI design libraries only: MUI core (@mui/material + emotion), Radix (radix-ui primitives + @radix-ui/themes) and Konsta UI (iOS-styled components). No full app frameworks (Ionic/Framework7), no MUI X, no Material icons, no state libs.",
